flowchart TD
  Q[Choose claim from filtered queue] --> C[Read exact claim and mandatory acceptance conditions]
  C --> E[Inspect full evidence context, entity, authority and dates]
  E --> S[Review separate provenance and illustrative semantic signals]
  S --> G{All mandatory gates resolved and assessment current?}
  G -->|Yes| D[Choose Approve, Request evidence or Reject]
  G -->|No| B[Approve disabled; choose Request evidence or Reject]
  D --> R[Enter reviewer rationale]
  B --> R
  R --> A[Record local human decision and audit event]
  A --> N[Next claim; preserve per-claim rationale and draft]
  C --> X[Edit claim wording]
  X --> I[Invalidate assessment and clear prior local approval]
  I --> U[Reset sample wording]
  U --> T[Explicitly restore baseline sample assessment; not a verifier run]
  T --> S
